  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC11-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh...? You're here about the warning? You mean you don't know? It's Eerkala, the Dark Djinni, the Dismal Dowager... she has returned!",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Dumoozid_MIR_09.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381137,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC11-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Eerkala once ruled all the Djinn. She made us do terrible things. But centuries ago, she was trapped in a bottle and buried beneath the sands.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Dumoozid_MIR_10.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381137,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC11-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Somehow, during the sand storm, Eerkala was set free, and she's put all Djinn on notice. She sent the Mud Swirlers, but she won't stop there.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Dumoozid_MIR_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381137,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC11-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Eerkala's return means dark times for all Mirage. That's why I sent the warning. If the nomads don't know, tell them. They must prepare. Go now!",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Dumoozid_MIR_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381137,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC11-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know it seems silly in light of Eerkala's return and all that, but if you come back, would you mind wiping your feet next time?",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Dumoozid_MIR_13.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
